their applications

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.000
before it's launched to stable.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.500
So if there are
security issues that

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:33.570
need to be mitigated
with an application,

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.360
